{"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"title":"EditingHolds","roleHeading":"Class","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxPersistence"}],"externalID":"s:17SwiduxPersistence12EditingHoldsC","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EditingHolds","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"class","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EditingHolds","kind":"identifier"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"IDs an app has declared it is editing, exempt from a re-hydration merge for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as long as the hold is in force.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxpersistence\/editingholds"]}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/EditingHolds\/init()"],"generated":true},{"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/EditingHolds\/ids","doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/EditingHolds\/isEmpty"],"generated":true},{"title":"Instance Methods","anchor":"Instance-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/EditingHolds\/hold(_:)","doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/EditingHolds\/isHolding(_:)","doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/EditingHolds\/release(_:)","doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/EditingHolds\/releaseAll()"],"generated":true}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/EditingHolds","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"final","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EditingHolds","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every other exemption is inferred: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Swidux\/EntityStore\/changes"},{"type":"text","text":", the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"writer’s drained-but-unflushed buffers, and the failed-flush ledger all"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"describe writes the "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"store","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" has seen. A value still sitting in a view’s local"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@State"},{"type":"text","text":" is in none of them, so under"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/MergePolicy\/preferRemote","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" a remote edit can land underneath a half-typed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"field and the user’s next keystroke dispatches against a value that changed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"out from under them."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A hold closes exactly that window, and nothing wider:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["TextEditor(text: $draft)","    .holdsEntity(note.id, in: persistence.editing)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Prefer that modifier — it takes the hold when the editor appears and gives it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"back when the editor goes away, so there is no release to forget. Reach for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/EditingHolds\/hold(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/EditingHolds\/release(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" directly only where the editing session","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"isn’t a view’s lifetime.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"What a hold is not","anchor":"What-a-hold-is-not","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A hold ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"defers a remote change; it does not veto one.","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" Release it and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"next merge applies whatever storage holds, including a deletion made"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"elsewhere. The worst a leaked hold can do is strand one row at a stale"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"value, which is what "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/MergePolicy\/preferInMemory","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" does on purpose. It is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not data loss, and it is not silent either: a merge that actually withheld a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"differing value reports"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceDiagnostic\/mergeWithheld(entityType:ids:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Two alternatives cost less and are often enough. ","type":"text"},{"code":"store.binding(_:sending:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"dispatches on write, which makes the value a drained-but-unflushed one and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"covers it already. ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/MergePolicy\/preferInMemory","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" exempts a whole collection","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"permanently. A hold sits between them: remote-wins stays on everywhere else,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and here only while the user is actually typing.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://SwiduxPersistence/documentation/SwiduxPersistence/EditingHolds/ids":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/EditingHolds\/ids","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpersistence\/editingholds\/ids","title":"ids","type":"topic","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every ID currently held, in no particular order."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ids"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","text":"Set"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV","text":"UUID"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://SwiduxPersistence/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"title":"Swift.SendableMetatype","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/s16SendableMetatypeP"},"doc://SwiduxPersistence/s8SendableP":{"type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/s8SendableP","title":"Swift.Sendable"},"doc://SwiduxPersistence/documentation/SwiduxPersistence/MergePolicy/preferRemote":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/MergePolicy\/preferRemote","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpersistence\/mergepolicy\/preferre